#4471 was marked known as one parser bug. Its 412 unique reports (427 export rows, 15 repeated) hold three separate problems. Each now has its own ticket in the course repo.

<Callout kind="warn">
Not one issue. A parser fix will not close the form-hint reports or the one-day-shift reports.
</Callout>

## What was merged

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

## Tickets

| problem | reports | ticket |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Parser reads day-first dates month first | 374 | [#1](https://github.com/edpittol/mega-s01e03-4471/issues/1) |
| booking-v3 form hint says MM/DD/YYYY to day-first tenants | 33 | [#2](https://github.com/edpittol/mega-s01e03-4471/issues/2) |
| Invites one day off (time-zone or date-boundary suspect) | 5 | [#3](https://github.com/edpittol/mega-s01e03-4471/issues/3) |

374 + 33 + 5 = 412. The table above counts the 5 under `parser`, where the desk files them by tenant; they are footnoted there.

Sources: report ids and counts from `src/lib/data/reports-4471.json` (unique by id), causes from `src/lib/kb/causes.ts`, the one-day reports from `src/lib/data/desk-notes.json`. Each ticket lists its report ids.

## Outcome

Engineering closed #4471 on 5 October (desk update on the Challenge page). All three tickets are closed to match:

| ticket | outcome |
| --- | --- |
| [#1](https://github.com/edpittol/mega-s01e03-4471/issues/1) parser | fixed: `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales` |
| [#2](https://github.com/edpittol/mega-s01e03-4471/issues/2) hint | won't fix: booking-v3 form retired |
| [#3](https://github.com/edpittol/mega-s01e03-4471/issues/3) one-day shift | closed without a desk ruling; reopen if one-day reports come back after the parser fix |

## Lessons

- Intake tags are a guess: 15 of the 33 form-hint reports were tagged `parser`.
- Merging on subject hides different causes ([decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject)). Check tenant and channel before you merge.

